It begins with an instrumental section that lasts almost two minutes.
The song went into trade in the United Kingdom, as a single in 1979, ranking in fifteenth place.
In addition, his album Bat Out of Hell remained nine years in the English charts, and was sold more than 40 million copies worldwide.
